# SMART HUB - Frontend Environment Configuration (.env.example)
#
# SECURITY NOTICE:
# Only variables prefixed with VITE_ are exposed to the client-side JavaScript bundle.
# NEVER place database credentials, JWT secrets, private keys, or server-only configs here.

# Frontend API Base URL
# - Leave blank or omitted in local development to route API requests via the Vite development proxy (http://localhost:5000).
# - In a unified-domain production deployment (e.g. reverse proxy where both frontend and backend share https://hub.institution.edu), leave blank or set to ''.
# - In a cross-domain production deployment (e.g., frontend on Vercel, backend on Render), set to your backend origin (e.g., https://api.smart-hub.institution.edu).
#
VITE_API_URL=
